# PDU bytes only: no MBAP header, no unit identifier.
# Modbus Application Protocol V1.1b section 6.11, Write Multiple Coils, request layout with a quantity of 1.
# Coil 173 (wire address 0x00AC) ON: byte count 1, data 01.
# Upstream never sends function 05, so a single coil is a Write Multiple Coils request (MB-QUIRK-C).
0F 00 AC 00 01 01 01
